<title>FRANCE: Elf -no comment on Elf Gabon buyout rumour.</title>
<headline>Elf -no comment on Elf Gabon buyout rumour.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French energy company Elf Aquitaine declined to comment on Monday on market rumours that it would propose a share exchange to minority stockholders in its subsidiary Elf Gabon.</p>
<p>Elf holds 58 percent of Elf Gabon.</p>
<p>Elf shares were up 1.2 percent at 583 francs at 1205 GMT, and Elf Gabon shares were 3.8 percent higher at 1,918 francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
